Have you tried controlling for the "width" and "height" of jitter? I would also recommend you add some transparency to your plot to show the more dense group in the middle. Something along the lines of

ggplot(abalone, aes(x = Diameter, y = Rings)) +
  theme_bw() +
  geom_jitter(position = position_jitter(width = 0.1, height = 0.25), alpha = 0.25)

Cheers,
Roman

